# INVWINKA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the note of a
# loan saved, on each of the loan screens, and of a service record
# deleted from an item's records, on the status bar as INV's hint row
# shows them.  Loans and holds shows item 1's loans, none: a loan added
# there and its contact saved is noted "Loan 1 saved", the next key
# ending the note.  The same change from Items > Loans and holds, the
# open rows, and from the overdue ones, four CTRL+PGDNs on, the loan
# being late, notes the same.  Back on the item list, Service records
# shows item 1's records, where DEL, once asked, notes "Service record 1
# deleted".  Every date is typed, so that no snapshot holds the day of
# the run.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINKA.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-C A INS
T 1
K TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
S LENT
K ENTER CTRL-E TAB
T 555-0100
K ENTER
S SAVEITEM
K ESC ALT-I O ENTER CTRL-E TAB
T 555-0101
K ENTER
S SAVEOPEN
K CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN ENTER CTRL-E TAB
T 555-0102
K ENTER
S SAVEOVER
K ESC ALT-C S DEL
S ASK
K Y
S DELETED
K ESC ALT-F X
